  <summary>Beat the right enemies to open the way</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Beat them all… or not. Gordon's path through the forest is blocked by electric barriers. Each barrier shows an enemy: an ant, a beetle or a spider. Only defeating that kind of enemy charges it, and once it is full, the way is open.
    </p>
    <p>
      Pick your targets, mix quick and heavy strikes into deadly combos and save your lightning for the right moment. At the end of every level, a mini boss drops from the sky to guard the gate.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Solo or two-player co-op on the same screen: one keyboard, keyboard + gamepad or two gamepads</li>
      <li>Quick and heavy attacks, with nine combo chains to discover</li>
      <li>Dash to dodge enemies and cancel any swing</li>
      <li>Kill streaks raising your score multiplier up to x4</li>
      <li>Lightning storm: spend your mana to strike everything around you</li>
      <li>A mini boss at every gate: the Mecha Mantis, with ground slams, rage mode and super armor</li>
      <li>Three enemy types: ants swarm you, beetles hit hard, spiders shoot from a distance</li>
      <li>Bonus stage: 15 seconds to hit the squirrels and grab extra life bottles</li>
      <li>Training mode with a practice dummy and the combo list on screen</li>
      <li>Remappable keyboard and gamepad controls, AZERTY and QWERTY presets</li>
      <li>Best scores, chiptune music, hit-stop, screen shake and particles</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Made with Godot 4.7, free and open source.
    </p>
  </description>
